## 3. Second-Level Directory Explanations

### `.github/`

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `workflows/` | GitHub Actions: lint/validate, WIF build+scan+sign, digest PR, Terraform plan |
| `ISSUE_TEMPLATE/` | Standardized bug and incident follow-up reports |
| `PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md` | Checklist: digest change, runbook link, game-day impact |
| `CODEOWNERS` | Required reviewers per path (terraform, gitops, docs/sre) |

### `terraform/`

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `modules/` | Reusable Terraform modules — each with `README.md`, `variables.tf`, `outputs.tf` |
| `environments/boutique/` | Root module wiring for single GCP project + cluster; GCS backend config |

### `gitops/`

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `bootstrap/` | Cluster foundation installed first — Argo CD, ESO operator, app-of-apps root |
| `apps/` | Workload definitions — Boutique Helm chart, Argo Application CRs |
| `policies/` | Admission and runtime policy — Kyverno ClusterPolicies, NetworkPolicies |

### `observability/`

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `otel/` | OpenTelemetry Collector deploy + export config (Trace, Managed Prometheus) |
| `prometheus/` | In-cluster Prometheus or agent config (if not fully managed-only) |
| `grafana/` | Dashboards, datasource provisioning |
| `monitoring/` | Cloud Monitoring SLOs, alert policies, uptime checks, log-based metrics |

### `docs/`

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `architecture/` | System design, data flows; canonical `overview.md` |
| `adr/` | Architecture Decision Records — one file per significant choice |
| `setup/` | Topic-based setup guides (user-executed, ordered index) |
| `bootstrap.md` | Single-page bootstrap summary linking setup guides |
| `dns.md` | DNS delegation, record table, validation commands |
| `teardown.md` | Destroy order, billing stop, orphan verification |
| `implementation/` | Phase roadmap and per-phase notes |
| `operations/` | Day-2 ops, rollback procedures |
| `security/` | Threat model, IAM matrix, supply chain controls |
| `troubleshooting/` | Symptom → cause → fix cross-cutting guides |
| `sre/` | SRE depth — runbooks, SLOs, game days, on-call, incident response |

### `docs/sre/` (SRE operations hub)

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `runbooks/` | One runbook per alert policy; linked from Cloud Monitoring |
| `postmortems/` | Blameless template + completed reports |
| `game-days/` | Scenario scripts, success criteria, inject steps |
| `oncall/` | Shift handoff, tooling, escalation paths |
| `incident-response/` | SEV definitions, comms templates |

### `scripts/`

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `bootstrap/` | Prerequisite validation (APIs, tools, auth) — not a setup replacement |
| `game-days/` | Chaos/latency/error injection for game day scenarios |
| `teardown/` | Pre-destroy checklist, orphan resource scan |

### `examples/`, `tests/`, `assets/`

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `examples/` | Snippets: ExternalSecret, Kyverno test fixture, WIF workflow excerpt |
| `tests/` | Kyverno CLI tests, kubeconform, Terraform validate tests |
| `assets/diagrams/` | Mermaid source for architecture, network, deployment pipeline |

