## 4. Important Files

### Root documentation

| File | Role | Dependencies |
|------|------|--------------|
| **`README.md`** | Portfolio front page — overview, quick start, links to `docs/setup/` | All major dirs exist |
| **`PROJECT.md`** | Project charter — goals, scope, non-goals, stakeholders, production bar | Architecture + roadmap |
| **`ARCHITECTURE.md`** | Pointer/summary to `docs/architecture/overview.md`; high-level diagram | Architecture rule content |
| **`ROADMAP.md`** | Pointer to `docs/implementation/roadmap.md`; phase status table | Project planning phases |
| **`CONTRIBUTING.md`** | PR process, branch strategy, digest promotion, manual Argo sync policy | `.github/` templates |
| **`SECURITY.md`** | Vulnerability reporting, security contacts, supply chain expectations | cosign, Binary Auth docs |
| **`Makefile`** | `validate`, `lint`, `test`, `tf-plan`, `kyverno-test` targets | pre-commit, tests/ |
| **`.pre-commit-config.yaml`** | gitleaks, terraform fmt, yaml lint, kubeconform | Local dev tooling |

### Key workflows (`.github/workflows/`)

| Workflow | Trigger | Purpose |
|----------|---------|---------|
| `ci.yml` | PR, push | pre-commit checks, manifest validate, Kyverno policy tests |
| `build-scan-sign.yml` | push main, dispatch | WIF auth → build/mirror → Trivy → AR push → cosign sign/attest |
| `manifest-digest-pr.yml` | after image push | Open PR updating `gitops/apps/boutique/values-images.yaml` digests |
| `terraform-plan.yml` | PR touching `terraform/` | `terraform plan` comment; no auto-apply to prod |

### Key Terraform modules (`terraform/modules/`)

| Module | Inputs (examples) | Outputs (examples) |
|--------|-------------------|---------------------|
| `networking` | `project_id`, `region`, CIDR ranges | `vpc_id`, `subnet_ids`, `router_nat` |
| `gke` | `cluster_name`, `node_pools`, `master_ipv4_cidr` | `cluster_endpoint`, `ca_certificate` |
| `dns` | `domain`, `static_ip` | `name_servers`, `record_fqdns` |
| `wif` | `github_org`, `github_repo`, `sa_roles` | `provider_name`, `sa_email` |
| `armor` | `policy_rules`, `rate_limits` | `security_policy_id` |
| `monitoring` | `uptime_urls`, `notification_channel_ids` | `uptime_check_ids`, `alert_policy_ids` |

Each module `README.md` must include: **Purpose**, **Inputs**, **Outputs**, **Dependencies**, **Usage** example.

### Key GitOps paths

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `gitops/bootstrap/root-app.yaml` | App-of-apps — Argo CD watches this to sync all platform + app Applications |
| `gitops/apps/argocd-apps/boutique-application.yaml` | Argo Application CR — source: Helm chart, destination: `boutique` namespace |
| `gitops/apps/boutique/values-images.yaml` | CI-managed digest pins — only file CI auto-updates via PR |
| `gitops/policies/kyverno/require-digest.yaml` | Enforces image `@sha256:` — pairs with Binary Authorization |

### Key bootstrap / lifecycle docs

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `docs/setup/README.md` | Ordered index, time estimates, dependency graph between topics |
| `docs/bootstrap.md` | Executive bootstrap path — links to setup guides 01–07 |
| `docs/dns.md` | Registrar NS delegation → Cloud DNS; A records for boutique + argocd |
| `docs/teardown.md` | Destroy order: GitOps apps → cluster → LB/IP → DNS → Terraform |
| `docs/sre/runbooks/*.md` | Linked from every Cloud Monitoring alert policy |

