## 5. Extension Path (Single → Multi-Environment)

Current: `terraform/environments/boutique/` and single Helm values.

Future without restructure:

```
terraform/environments/
├── boutique/          # current
└── staging/           # optional later — same modules, different tfvars

gitops/apps/boutique/
├── values.yaml        # shared defaults
└── values-boutique.yaml / values-staging.yaml   # env overlays via Argo Application
```

Namespaces remain the isolation boundary until a second cluster is justified (see ADR `001-single-cluster.md`).

